URIs and short citations (\code{\link[=spdf_anchor_uri]{spdf_anchor_uri()}}, \code{\link[=spdf_cite]{spdf_cite()}}), exports CSL-JSON and
BibTeX (\code{\link[=spdf_csl]{spdf_csl()}}, \code{\link[=spdf_bibtex]{spdf_bibtex()}}), writes new files (\code{\link[=spdf_write]{spdf_write()}}) and works
over corpora (\code{\link[=spdf_corpus_search]{spdf_corpus_search()}}, \code{\link[=spdf_count_terms]{spdf_count_terms()}}).
